1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,280
(Leonard:)Come on, who's with me?

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,390
(Leonard:)Free comic books
to anyone who comes with me.

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,560
(Leonard:)I might get punched.
You really want to miss that?

4
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,170
(Raj:)Junior Mints are
pretty apologetic.

5
00:00:18,170 --> 00:00:20,330
(Sheldon:)You're embarrassing
yourself.

6
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,770
(Leonard:)Penny.

7
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,410
(Penny:)What?
Yeah,

8
00:00:32,410 --> 00:00:34,110
(Leonard:)we came to talk to Zack.
Hey, Zack.

9
00:00:34,120 --> 00:00:35,320
(Zack:)What do you want?

10
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,680
(Leonard:)Listen,

11
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,780
(Leonard:)the stuff
we were saying before--

12
00:00:37,790 --> 00:00:39,350
(Leonard:)we were just kidding around.

13
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,290
(Zack:)No, you weren't.

14
00:00:40,290 --> 00:00:41,960
(Zack:)You were making fun
of me.

15
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:43,590
(Leonard:)Come on, that's what we do.

16
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,690
(Leonard:)We give each other a hard time.

17
00:00:45,690 --> 00:00:46,890
(Leonard:)Hey, Sheldon,

18
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:49,100
(Leonard:)you look
like a praying mantis.

19
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,000
(Sheldon:)That's very hurtful.

20
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,300
(Leonard:)See?

21
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:57,140
(Leonard:)I don't know,
it still wasn't very nice.

